      "language": "zh",
      "question": "除了波塞冬、哈迪斯、赫斯提亚和德墨忒尔之外，哪位希腊主要神明也是瑞亚的孩子？",
      "expected_answer": "赫拉",
      "answer_aliases": [
        "希腊神话"
      ],
      "translation_note": "Direct translation of the core question."
    },
    {
      "source_qa_id": "mythology_systems__major_deities__011__target__greek_major_deities_2__en__surface_001",
      "language": "zh",
      "question": "请说出与波塞冬、哈迪斯、赫斯提亚和德墨忒尔一起被提及的瑞亚的孩子是哪位希腊主要神明。",
      "expected_answer": "赫拉",
      "answer_aliases": [
        "希腊神话"
      ],
      "translation_note": "Rephrased as an imperative command."
    },
    {
      "source_qa_id": "mythology_systems__major_deities__011__target__greek_major_deities_2__en__surface_002",
      "language": "zh",
      "question": "在希腊神话中，哪位主要人物与德墨忒尔、赫斯提亚、哈迪斯和波塞冬一起被列为瑞亚的孩子？",
      "expected_answer": "赫拉",
      "answer_aliases": [
        "希腊神话"
      ],
      "translation_note": "Changed the order of the siblings and used 'major figure in Greek mythology'."
    },
    {
      "source_qa_id": "mythology_systems__major_deities__011__target__greek_major_deities_2__en__surface_003",
      "language": "zh",
      "question": "在希腊神话中，谁与波塞冬、哈迪斯、赫斯提亚和德墨忒尔一起构成了瑞亚的孩子们？",
      "expected_answer": "赫拉",
      "answer_aliases": [
        "希腊神话"
      ],
      "translation_note": "Framed as completing a specific group of siblings."
    },
    {
      "source_qa_id": "mythology_systems__major_deities__011__neighbor__norse_major_deities_2__en__core",
      "language": "zh",
      "question": "哪位身旁有乌鸦相伴的神明是北欧神话中的主要人物？",
      "expected_answer": "奥丁",
      "answer_aliases": [
        "Óðinn"
      ],
      "translation_note": "Direct translation of the core question."
    },
    {
      "source_qa_id": "mythology_systems__major_deities__011__neighbor__norse_major_deities_2__en__surface_001",
      "language": "zh",
      "question": "北欧神话文献中提到的身旁有乌鸦相伴的主要神明是谁？",
      "expected_answer": "奥丁",
      "answer_aliases": [
        "Óðinn"
      ],
      "translation_note": "Incorporates 'source texts' from the fact statement."
